    "body": "This sets `permissions: contents: read` for the CI workflow and `persist-credentials: false` on `actions/checkout`. The matching change in Bitcoin Core is bitcoin/bitcoin#36513, for bitcoin/bitcoin#36512. Pinning actions and images is left out to stay in sync with Core, which declined it because of the maintenance pins need (bitcoin/bitcoin#35754, bitcoin/bitcoin#36512), though tags have been moved to a malicious commit before ([GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3)).\n\nPart of #1959.\n",
